{"book": "workbook", "page": 101, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "rows": [{"text": "新HSK教程1学练手册", "confidence": 0.99629, "box": [[0.11849, 0.03147], [0.2958, 0.03147], [0.2958, 0.04454], [0.11849, 0.04454]]}, {"text": "NewHSKCourse1Workbook", "confidence": 0.99513, "box": [[0.31849, 0.03207], [0.51681, 0.03207], [0.51681, 0.04513], [0.31849, 0.04513]]}, {"text": "二、汉字", "confidence": 0.99821, "box": [[0.18067, 0.08907], [0.30336, 0.08907], [0.30336, 0.1152], [0.18067, 0.1152]]}, {"text": "Chinese Characters", "confidence": 0.98718, "box": [[0.32353, 0.09798], [0.47899, 0.09976], [0.47899, 0.1158], [0.32353, 0.11342]]}, {"text": "汉字书写（六）Chinese Character Writing (VI)", "confidence": 0.96029, "box": [[0.33193, 0.14371], [0.72689, 0.14608], [0.72689, 0.1639], [0.33193, 0.16152]]}, {"text": "认识汉字结构：独体字与合体字IntroductiontoChineseCharacterStructures:", "confidence": 0.99571, "box": [[0.19916, 0.18943], [0.88824, 0.19062], [0.88824, 0.20665], [0.19916, 0.20546]]}, {"text": "Single-Component Characters and Compound Characters", "confidence": 0.96875, "box": [[0.2042, 0.21259], [0.65378, 0.21259], [0.65378, 0.22981], [0.2042, 0.22981]]}, {"text": "独体字和合体字是汉字的两种基本结构。独体字是由基本笔画构成的不能拆分为两", "confidence": 0.99831, "box": [[0.23782, 0.24109], [0.88739, 0.24169], [0.88739, 0.25713], [0.23782, 0.25653]]}, {"text": "个或两个以上部件或偏旁的汉字，例如：“人”就是由一撇（」）一捺（）两个笔画", "confidence": 0.97617, "box": [[0.20336, 0.26603], [0.88655, 0.26663], [0.88655, 0.28207], [0.20336, 0.28147]]}, {"text": "构成的独体字。合体字是由两个或两个以上的部件或偏旁组成的汉字，例如：“认”就", "confidence": 0.99865, "box": [[0.2042, 0.29216], [0.88739, 0.29216], [0.88739, 0.30582], [0.2042, 0.30582]]}, {"text": "是由言字旁“”和“人”组成的合体字。", "confidence": 0.99565, "box": [[0.2042, 0.3171], [0.53782, 0.3171], [0.53782, 0.33076], [0.2042, 0.33076]]}, {"text": "形声字，即由形旁和声旁组成的合体字。形旁主要表示意义类别，声旁主要提示", "confidence": 0.9992, "box": [[0.2395, 0.34204], [0.88571, 0.34204], [0.88571, 0.3557], [0.2395, 0.3557]]}, {"text": "字音。多数形声字可以通过形旁快速确定字义类别，借助声旁辅助推测读音，能有效", "confidence": 0.99922, "box": [[0.20336, 0.3652], [0.88655, 0.3658], [0.88655, 0.38064], [0.20336, 0.38005]]}, {"text": "帮助我们理解和记忆汉字。例如：“奶、姥、妈、姐、妹”，左边的“女”为形旁，", "confidence": 0.99778, "box": [[0.2042, 0.39133], [0.87647, 0.39133], [0.87647, 0.40499], [0.2042, 0.40499]]}, {"text": "表示这些字的意义与女性相关，右边的“乃、老、马、且、未”是声旁，可以", "confidence": 0.99906, "box": [[0.20252, 0.41508], [0.88655, 0.41508], [0.88655, 0.43052], [0.20252, 0.43052]]}, {"text": "通过声旁推测这些字的读音。", "confidence": 0.99909, "box": [[0.20252, 0.43884], [0.43193, 0.44002], [0.43109, 0.45606], [0.20252, 0.45428]]}, {"text": "Chinese characters fall into two basic structural types: single-component characters and", "confidence": 0.98236, "box": [[0.23866, 0.46496], [0.88824, 0.46496], [0.88824, 0.48219], [0.23866, 0.48219]]}, {"text": "compound characters.A single-component character is a Chinese character formed by basic", "confidence": 0.98739, "box": [[0.20252, 0.4899], [0.88739, 0.48931], [0.88739, 0.50653], [0.20252, 0.50713]]}, {"text": "strokes and cannot be divided into two or more components orradicals.For example:“人(ren)\"", "confidence": 0.9656, "box": [[0.20336, 0.51603], [0.88571, 0.51603], [0.88571, 0.53147], [0.20336, 0.53147]]}, {"text": "is a single-component character composed of two strokes—one left-falling stroke (J） and one", "confidence": 0.98294, "box": [[0.2, 0.54038], [0.88655, 0.53979], [0.88655, 0.55701], [0.2, 0.5576]]}, {"text": "right-falling stroke ( ). A compound character consists of two or more components, which can", "confidence": 0.98283, "box": [[0.20084, 0.56473], [0.88655, 0.56413], [0.88655, 0.58195], [0.20084, 0.58254]]}, {"text": "be single-component characters or radicals.For instance:“认(ren)”is a compound character", "confidence": 0.9806, "box": [[0.20168, 0.59086], [0.88571, 0.59026], [0.88571, 0.60629], [0.20168, 0.60689]]}, {"text": "formed by the semantic radical\"\"and the“人\"", "confidence": 0.91138, "box": [[0.20252, 0.61639], [0.55966, 0.61639], [0.55966, 0.63124], [0.20252, 0.63124]]}, {"text": "A phono-semantic compound character is a compound Chinese character composed of a", "confidence": 0.98434, "box": [[0.23613, 0.63777], [0.88824, 0.63658], [0.88824, 0.65439], [0.23613, 0.65558]]}, {"text": "semantic radical and a phonetic radical. The semantic radical primarily indicates the category", "confidence": 0.98279, "box": [[0.20084, 0.66093], [0.88571, 0.66152], [0.88571, 0.67755], [0.20084, 0.67696]]}, {"text": "of meaning, while the phonetic radical mainly provides a cue for pronunciation. For most", "confidence": 0.99618, "box": [[0.20084, 0.68349], [0.88908, 0.68349], [0.88908, 0.70131], [0.20084, 0.70131]]}, {"text": "phono-semanticcompound characters,thesemanticradical enables us toquicklyidentifythe", "confidence": 0.9666, "box": [[0.20168, 0.70724], [0.88571, 0.70724], [0.88571, 0.72209], [0.20168, 0.72209]]}, {"text": "general meaning category, and the phonetic radical helps infer the pronunciation, which can", "confidence": 0.99134, "box": [[0.2, 0.72922], [0.88739, 0.72803], [0.88739, 0.74525], [0.2, 0.74644]]}, {"text": "characters“奶”,“姥”，“妈”，“姐”,and“妹”,the component“女”on the left functions as the", "confidence": 0.9348, "box": [[0.20168, 0.77316], [0.88655, 0.77435], [0.88655, 0.79038], [0.20168, 0.78919]]}, {"text": "semantic radical, denoting meanings related to females, while the components “J\",“老”,“\",", "confidence": 0.94825, "box": [[0.20084, 0.79632], [0.88655, 0.79632], [0.88655, 0.81354], [0.20084, 0.81354]]}, {"text": "“目\", and “木” on the right serve as phonetic radicals, through which the pronunciations of", "confidence": 0.96431, "box": [[0.20084, 0.81651], [0.88908, 0.81829], [0.88908, 0.8361], [0.20084, 0.83432]]}, {"text": "these characters can be inferred.", "confidence": 0.99099, "box": [[0.2, 0.84026], [0.43361, 0.84086], [0.43361, 0.85689], [0.2, 0.85629]]}, {"text": "类型Character Types", "confidence": 0.94342, "box": [[0.28235, 0.8652], [0.46218, 0.86758], [0.46134, 0.8848], [0.28235, 0.88242]]}, {"text": "例字 Example Characters", "confidence": 0.95196, "box": [[0.60924, 0.86639], [0.81681, 0.86758], [0.81681, 0.8848], [0.60924, 0.88361]]}, {"text": "独体字Single-ComponentCharacters", "confidence": 0.98876, "box": [[0.22773, 0.88955], [0.51849, 0.89133], [0.51849, 0.90855], [0.22689, 0.90677]]}, {"text": "口、上、下...….", "confidence": 0.75185, "box": [[0.6521, 0.89133], [0.77479, 0.89133], [0.77479, 0.90736], [0.6521, 0.90736]]}, {"text": "合体字Compound Characters", "confidence": 0.99686, "box": [[0.2563, 0.9139], [0.4916, 0.91508], [0.4916, 0.9323], [0.25546, 0.93112]]}, {"text": "和、认、什..…", "confidence": 0.75622, "box": [[0.6479, 0.91627], [0.77479, 0.91627], [0.77479, 0.9323], [0.6479, 0.9323]]}, {"text": "094", "confidence": 0.99851, "box": [[0.11681, 0.94834], [0.15378, 0.94656], [0.15462, 0.96259], [0.11849, 0.96437]]}]}